<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70477" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νευρά</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νερτερο-ρή</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Ep.
		 gen. sg. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νευρῆφι</span></b> (
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν</span></b> ) <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			8.309
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			15.313
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			21.113
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>string</i>
			or <i>cord of sinew,</i> in 
				Ep.
			 usu. <i>bowstring,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. ἐϋστρεφής, νεόστροφος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.463
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				469
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρύφθογγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					6(5).34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1005
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				784
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.2.28
			</span></i>, etc.: made from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῦρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				540a19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύες ἐβοήθησαν διατραγόντες τὰς ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1401b16
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>harpstring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>strand</i> of a torsion-engine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.554.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>withe,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				16.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> wrongly taken
			by some, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῦρον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.328
			</span></i>. (Cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῦρον.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
